{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"id": "xaji0y6dpbhsahxthv3a", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 1267.2, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1730483679, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 342865763, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "RepoPilot — the backend explained", "originalText": "RepoPilot — the backend explained", "fontSize": 64, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "zmf8mdd4v30t9nt3w5uz", "type": "text", "x": 0, "y": 90, "width": 1792.0000000000002, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 98407117, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1420052173, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A visual guide for a Java / Spring Boot developer. Read the sections top to bottom: 1 → big picture, 2 → classes, 3 → the full /index workflow, 4 → Java IO, 5 →\nsecurity, 6 → chunking, 7 → embeddings, 8 → search, 9 → config & tests, 10 → what's next.", "originalText": "A visual guide for a Java / Spring Boot developer. Read the sections top to bottom: 1 → big picture, 2 → classes, 3 → the full /index workflow, 4 → Java IO, 5 →\nsecurity, 6 → chunking, 7 → embeddings, 8 → search, 9 → config & tests, 10 → what's next.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "lsehuds3qsqcq30o30ub", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 200, "width": 1900, "height": 937.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 739870105, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504065082, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ikcidkwnnhj7xvg0fn9x", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 230, "width": 768.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1196040477, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 471619988, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1. The big picture: RAG for code", "originalText": "1. The big picture: RAG for code", "fontSize": 40, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "y41ibljh75lxo6qjiujv", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 288, "width": 1804.3200000000002, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1928059963, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1253127417, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "RepoPilot's goal: 'chat with a GitHub repository'. An LLM cannot read a whole repo at once (too big, too expensive), so we use RAG = Retrieval-Augmented Generation. We prepare the\ncode once (INGESTION), then for every question we only RETRIEVE the few relevant pieces and give those to the LLM.", "originalText": "RepoPilot's goal: 'chat with a GitHub repository'. An LLM cannot read a whole repo at once (too big, too expensive), so we use RAG = Retrieval-Augmented Generation. We prepare the\ncode once (INGESTION), then for every question we only RETRIEVE the few relevant pieces and give those to the LLM.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "oh9sdbdw2pcn9t84azyt", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 363.0, "width": 910.8, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 573002725, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1650553202, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PHASE A — INGESTION  (done once per repo, POST /api/dev/github/index)", "originalText": "PHASE A — INGESTION  (done once per repo, POST /api/dev/github/index)", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "la753lc58drc11ertj5p", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 408.0, "width": 210, "height": 110, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xepq85jsg65kxvf1t2ta"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 454833169, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1994826544, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "t0hl9xpseimvihcwi64c", "type": "text", "x": 85.6, "y": 440.625, "width": 118.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "grou