omes from: file path, start\nline, end line. It is the unit that gets embedded, stored,\nsearched and shown to the user.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "uzvgww4fyb8dalfyo175", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 950.0, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["r5xqt4p501nouhtcs1k9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1580198511, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1562084114, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ye9o2m71hssbelrqvslw", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 966.0, "width": 108.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["r5xqt4p501nouhtcs1k9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 348970488, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 843863541, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Embedding", "originalText": "Embedding", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "90km3tzk3ny9v20yar82", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 1001.0, "width": 537.6, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["r5xqt4p501nouhtcs1k9"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1666795256, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1242264175, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A list of numbers (here 1536 floats) produced by an AI model\nfrom a text. Texts with similar meaning get vectors that\npoint in similar directions.", "originalText": "A list of numbers (here 1536 floats) produced by an AI model\nfrom a text. Texts with similar meaning get vectors that\npoint in similar directions.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "7o75rh8lx6dut076g5g7", "type": "rectangle", "x": 656.6666666666666, "y": 950.0, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 147.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "#c5f6fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cehlxslg6mm1zxyvgiui"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2141410144, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795732689, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "9kkhzlm72jeyn9382kkz", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 966.0, "width": 144.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cehlxslg6mm1zxyvgiui"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 743809981, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1984295580, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Vector store", "originalText": "Vector store", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "pjrht7zewviytwbozd1a", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 1001.0, "width": 537.6, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cehlxslg6mm1zxyvgiui"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1181873122, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100047252, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A database that stores vectors and can answer 'which stored\nvectors are the closest to this one?'. Here: PostgreSQL with\nthe pgvector extension, used through Spring AI's VectorStore\ninterface.", "originalText": "A database that stores vectors and can answer 'which stored\nvectors are the closest to this one?'. Here: PostgreSQL with\nthe pgvector extension, used through Spring AI's VectorStore\ninterface.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "0votqtxhi15cqzcuctsu", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1273.3333333333333, "y": 950.0, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["or7875aud9k9tr74qgef"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 321805549, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 353340849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "qjg02u1g463sdygfliji", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 966.0, "width": 204.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["or7875aud9k9tr74qgef"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1618680085, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 573365944, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Similarity search", "originalText": "Similarity search", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "8k0axycelos6zle6kwhe", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 1001.0, "width": 546.5600000000001, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["or7875aud9k9tr74qgef"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 328963498, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 977059249, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Compute the cosine similarity between the question vector and\nthe stored vectors, return the top K (here K = 3). It is a\nsearch by meaning, not by exact keywords.", "originalText": "Compute the cosine similarity between the question vector and\nthe stored vectors, return the top K (here K = 3). It is a\nsearch by meaning, not by exact keywords.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "g3v23gxj0mqvindh4spf", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 1277.0, "width": 1900, "height": 1956.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 206799621, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 381011240, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "c97c7bo119xp9n56nyxt", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1307.0, "width": 648.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1403453781, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1847451373, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2. Every class and its role", "originalText": "2. Every class and its role", "fontSize": 40, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "mgtt0iaakytt3imj70e3", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1365.0, "width": 1794.2400000000002, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 900312333, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1320537522, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Base package dev.ayman.repopilot. Each column is a Java package. Spring creates one object (a 'bean') for each class annotated @Component / @Service / @RestController and injects\nthem into each other through the constructor.", "originalText": "Base package dev.ayman.repopilot. Each column is a Java package. Spring creates one object (a 'bean') for each class annotated @Component / @Service / @RestController and injects\nthem into each other through the constructor.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "15ahdbvzb0oih5csk30l", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 1440.0, "width": 432.5, "height": 50, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1284018420, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1659013169, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ylkfxhkc856wpr97y2lo", "type": "text", "x": 130.85000000000002, "y": 1452.0, "width": 250.7