": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["n1r4kz36u8ueihx74d0g"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2007378061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1254198957, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "isValid(url) → boolean. Accepts ONLY\nhttps://github.com/{owner}/{repo}: https\nscheme, host github.com, no user:password@, no\nport, no ?query, no #fragment, and a path\nmatching the regex ^/owner/repo$. Prevents us\nfrom calling arbitrary URLs.", "originalText": "isValid(url) → boolean. Accepts ONLY\nhttps://github.com/{owner}/{repo}: https\nscheme, host github.com, no user:password@, no\nport, no ?query, no #fragment, and a path\nmatching the regex ^/owner/repo$. Prevents us\nfrom calling arbitrary URLs.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "m7pyxdw2zcfzw0ldalmj", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 1707.0, "width": 432.5, "height": 309.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xcb48y1o4izasnwywrra"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 284556629, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 187469381, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "tatj9a3y36ddfgs3jono", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 1723.0, "width": 367.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xcb48y1o4izasnwywrra"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1213332960, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 522284974, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GithubRepositoryClient  @Component", "originalText": "GithubRepositoryClient  @Component", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "9iy4x41dntcagrp2u4dt", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 1755.5, "width": 369.6, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xcb48y1o4izasnwywrra"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 91379209, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 493419802, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "fetchRepo(url) → RepositoryInfo(owner, name,\ndefaultBranch, commitSha).", "originalText": "fetchRepo(url) → RepositoryInfo(owner, name,\ndefaultBranch, commitSha).", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "h55rbc76ub7l8v1zocfi", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 1803.0, "width": 394.8, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xcb48y1o4izasnwywrra"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1792398424, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1824163713, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Makes 2 calls to the GitHub REST API with\nSpring's RestClient:\n1. GET /repos/{owner}/{repo} → default_branch\n   (e.g. main)\n2. GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits/{branch} →\n   sha of the latest commit", "originalText": "Makes 2 calls to the GitHub REST API with\nSpring's RestClient:\n1. GET /repos/{owner}/{repo} → default_branch\n   (e.g. main)\n2. GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/commits/{branch} →\n   sha of the latest commit", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "o6l1f90s9bp4m18o1bj9", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 1925.5, "width": 394.8, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xcb48y1o4izasnwywrra"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1053562904, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 489923463, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The JSON is mapped into small private records\n(GithubRepoResponse, GithubCommitResponse).\nPinning the commit SHA means the whole pipeline\nworks on one exact snapshot.", "originalText": "The JSON is mapped into small private records\n(GithubRepoResponse, GithubCommitResponse).\nPinning the commit SHA means the whole pipeline\nworks on one exact snapshot.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "ajssuuqo1vsmado8e7fl", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 2036.5, "width": 432.5, "height": 290.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["gqtoamdvlnknd669ugne"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 977819382, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1684206998, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "krcpprcjiwvhdk8lw2lm", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 2052.5, "width": 334.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["gqtoamdvlnknd669ugne"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1751220237, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1768528453, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GithubArchiveClient  @Component", "originalText": "GithubArchiveClient  @Component", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "49el8hl88kzruin3oeuv", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 2085.0, "width": 361.20000000000005, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["gqtoamdvlnknd669ugne"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1171729552, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 386390746, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "download(owner, repo, sha) → Path of a temp\n.zip file.", "originalText": "download(owner, repo, sha) → Path of a temp\n.zip file.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "yt8qzpky32orwixz2c9r", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 2132.5, "width": 361.20000000000005, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["gqtoamdvlnknd669ugne"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 860722397, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1147545253, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GET /repos/{o}/{r}/zipball/{sha}. GitHub\nanswers with a 302 redirect to\ncodeload.github.com, so the HTTP client is\nconfigured to follow redirects. The body is\nread as byte[] and written to a temp file\n(details in section 4).", "originalText": "GET /repos/{o}/{r}/zipball/{sha}. GitHub\nanswers with a 302 redirect to\ncodeload.github.com, so the HTTP client is\nconfigured to follow redirects. The body is\nread as byte[] and written to a temp file\n(details in section 4).", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "s7yt2m6twd1xmxb9yo18", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 2255.0, "width": 378.00000000000006, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["gqtoamdvlnknd669ugne"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 924396245, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 227514201, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Has a package-private constructor taking a\nbaseUrl so tests can point it at a fake local\nserver.", "originalText": "Has a package-private constructor taking a\nbaseUrl so tests can point it at a fake local\nserver.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "t9d31k9qm3p91i3vmzwf", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 2347.25, "width": 432.5, "height": 197.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["hrrpzlk3e4xyf9igfu8i"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 299004808, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1685451070, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ogxpbwhvnzh13cd5glqj", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 2363.25, "width": 399.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColo