edding-001 → 1536-dimension vectors\ngemini chat model → text answers", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "hm38kszbffzzdvg7oq2z", "type": "text", "x": 1443.5, "y": 1746.75, "width": 386.40000000000003, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["uu9ymszdximyn4u9bxf4"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 231425171, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1625965833, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The key comes from the GOOGLE_API_KEY env var.", "originalText": "The key comes from the GOOGLE_API_KEY env var.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "50ui22kx7n89ltajw253", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1427.5, "y": 1801.5, "width": 432.5, "height": 120.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "#c5f6fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["nv5sn961j88qeoz0kz4z"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1957402082, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1361050431, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "7whwkmy9x8sylemruyp0", "type": "text", "x": 1443.5, "y": 1817.5, "width": 367.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["nv5sn961j88qeoz0kz4z"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1806869773, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1146547545, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PostgreSQL 17 + pgvector  (Docker)", "originalText": "PostgreSQL 17 + pgvector  (Docker)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "k43safyh1fkj4yk1b3d5", "type": "text", "x": 1443.5, "y": 1850.0, "width": 386.40000000000003, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["nv5sn961j88qeoz0kz4z"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1588048013, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1206638801, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "compose.yaml starts the pgvector/pgvector:pg17\nimage on localhost:5433. Flyway creates the\nvector extension and the vector_store table.", "originalText": "compose.yaml starts the pgvector/pgvector:pg17\nimage on localhost:5433. Flyway creates the\nvector extension and the vector_store table.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "tk63n2qb6gs8g8tacy15", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1427.5, "y": 1942.25, "width": 432.5, "height": 158.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["zx1tv18kgyggsnpuevjl"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 910982862, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1794577092, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "zfflb7wxrum2lhgcsotd", "type": "text", "x": 1443.5, "y": 1958.25, "width": 334.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["zx1tv18kgyggsnpuevjl"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 475019264, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1897080056, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Spring AI beans you never wrote", "originalText": "Spring AI beans you never wrote", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "hlmh1t939ayq6ww8yl68", "type": "text", "x": 1443.5, "y": 1990.75, "width": 394.8, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["zx1tv18kgyggsnpuevjl"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 828662267, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 551024022, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "VectorStore (PgVectorStore), EmbeddingModel and\nChatClient.Builder are created by the\nspring-ai-starter-* dependencies and configured\nby application.yaml. That is why your classes\ncan just ask for them in their constructors.", "originalText": "VectorStore (PgVectorStore), EmbeddingModel and\nChatClient.Builder are created by the\nspring-ai-starter-* dependencies and configured\nby application.yaml. That is why your classes\ncan just ask for them in their constructors.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "uov6tt9q1ni10kqsosx4", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 2847.5, "width": 895.0, "height": 346.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["dtz91x70fqldb2uuijnw"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1732031580, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2108513692, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "paytxw1vzc7d2kd1poxr", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 2863.5, "width": 612.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["dtz91x70fqldb2uuijnw"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1145613311, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 472158055, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "How Spring wires it: constructor injection + Lombok", "originalText": "How Spring wires it: constructor injection + Lombok", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "eo2t8fy620n8tteavt8k", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 2898.5, "width": 833.2800000000001, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["dtz91x70fqldb2uuijnw"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1606954678, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1592209840, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "@RequiredArgsConstructor (Lombok) generates a constructor taking every `private final` field.\nSpring sees one constructor and calls it with the matching beans:", "originalText": "@RequiredArgsConstructor (Lombok) generates a constructor taking every `private final` field.\nSpring sees one constructor and calls it with the matching beans:", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "6moxsfh4gg24479qtkcd", "type": "rectangle", "x": 56.0, "y": 2948.5, "width": 863.0, "height": 199.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["dtz91x70fqldb2uuijnw"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1558191062, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1246819673, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "rlexdw6lqwlvunlpaih0", "type": "text", "x": 68.0, "y": 2960.5, "width": 643.86, "height": 175.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["dtz91x70fqldb2uuijnw"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 936569305, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 594165409, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "@RestController\n@RequiredArgsConstructor\npublic class GithubTestController {\n    private final GithubUrlValidator validator;\n    private final GithubRepositoryClient client;\n    private final GithubArchiveClient archiveClient;\n    private final RepositorySourceExtractor extractor;\n    private final JavaCodeChunker chunker;\n    private final RepositoryIndexingService indexingService;\n    // Lombok writes: public GithubTestController(validator, client, ...)", "originalText": "@RestController\n@RequiredArgsConstructor\npublic class GithubTestController {\n    private final GithubUrlValidator validator;\n    private final GithubRepositoryClient client;\n    private final GithubArchiveClient archiveClient;\n    private final RepositorySourceExtractor extractor;\n    private final JavaCodeChunker chunker;\n    private final RepositoryIndexingService indexingService;\n    // Lombok writes: public GithubTestController(validator, client, ...)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "4e05qmktgv44ftj5ccas", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 3157.5, "width": 698.8800000000001, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["dtz91x70fqldb2uuijnw"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 66989096, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1745136260, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "@Slf4j adds `private static final Logger log`, so you can call log.debug(...).", "originalText": "@Slf4j adds `private static final Logger log`, so you can call log.debug(...).", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "abufwbucjg8vuazxkdq9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 965.0, "y": 2847.5, "width": 895.0, "height": 227.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["wfsqg8x80rmhrcnbh6nq"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1862517721, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1034375015, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "qb9lzs34jtgxnx4sn6sm", "type": "text", "x": 981.0, "y": 2863.5, "width": 348.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["wfsqg8x80rmhrcnbh6nq"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1863413280, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 740951277, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Java features used everywhere", "originalText": "Java features used everywhere", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "rrvsffcxhgnzei3zrrhf", "type": "text", "x": 981.0, "y": 2898.5, "width": 860.1600000000001, "height": 160.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["wfsqg8x80rmhrcnbh6nq"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1789637709, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 882399331, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "• record: immutable data class (CodeChunk, RepositoryInfo, SearchResult)\n• text block \"\"\" ... \"\"\": multi-line strings (sample code in CodeSearchService)\n• var: local type inference (var info = client.fetchRepo(url))\n• Map.of(...) / List.of(...): small immutable collections (JSON responses, metadata)\n• Stream API: chunks.stream().map(...).toList(), Files.walk(...).filter(...)\n• try-with-resources: try (var zip = new ZipInputStream(...)) { ... } closes automatically\n• Checked exceptions: IOException is declared with `throws` and Spring turns it into a 500 error\n  response", "originalText": "• record: immutable data class (CodeChunk, RepositoryInfo, SearchResult)\n• text block \"\"\" ... \"\"\": multi-line strings (sample code in CodeSearchService)\n• var: local type inference (var info = client.fetchRepo(url))\n• Map.of(...) / List.of(...): small immutable collections (JSON responses, metadata)\n• Stream API: chunks.stream().map(...).toList(), Files.walk(...).filter(...)\n• try-with-resources: try (var zip = new ZipInputStream(...)) { ... } closes automatically\n• Checked exceptions: IOException is declared with `throws` and Spring turns it into a 500 error\n  response", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": 