"rectangle", "x": 56.0, "y": 8135.0, "width": 400.5, "height": 41.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2oi6oafn33vm89i9gx32"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 163880249, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 451607155, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ynl63gaguvb99rwtf07g", "type": "text", "x": 68.0, "y": 8147.0, "width": 291.06, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2oi6oafn33vm89i9gx32"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 63469403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1150952836, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "https://github.com/{owner}/{repo}", "originalText": "https://github.com/{owner}/{repo}", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "asf5ehlh07jr8mtk0rso", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 8186.5, "width": 385.28000000000003, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2oi6oafn33vm89i9gx32"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 414580831, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 537070959, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "and the regex\n^/([a-zA-Z0-9-]+)/([a-zA-Z0-9._-]+)$ has no\nslash or '..' in the owner part.\nGithubValidatorTest covers the gitlab, http\nand /issues cases.", "originalText": "and the regex\n^/([a-zA-Z0-9-]+)/([a-zA-Z0-9._-]+)$ has no\nslash or '..' in the owner part.\nGithubValidatorTest covers the gitlab, http\nand /issues cases.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "adlypgg6n6975j2d8clw", "type": "rectangle", "x": 502.5, "y": 7969.0, "width": 432.5, "height": 217.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cgbsvk3x8mbgl2mcxn2e"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1744799387, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 815091300, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "lalq26unvsdkv54c6p1l", "type": "text", "x": 518.5, "y": 7985.0, "width": 336.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cgbsvk3x8mbgl2mcxn2e"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 687455504, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 425524780, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2. Zip Slip (path traversal)", "originalText": "2. Zip Slip (path traversal)", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "h2r9peglnukx496k4o67", "type": "text", "x": 518.5, "y": 8020.0, "width": 385.28000000000003, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cgbsvk3x8mbgl2mcxn2e"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 84010087, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 724539221, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A zip entry name is just a string chosen by\nwhoever made the zip. '../../x' would write\nOUTSIDE the temp folder and could overwrite\nyour files.", "originalText": "A zip entry name is just a string chosen by\nwhoever made the zip. '../../x' would write\nOUTSIDE the temp folder and could overwrite\nyour files.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "xcd20j1oulwozq48enwb", "type": "text", "x": 518.5, "y": 8110.0, "width": 376.32000000000005, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cgbsvk3x8mbgl2mcxn2e"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 102723247, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1772654411, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Fix: resolve → normalize (removes ..) →\ncheck startsWith(destination). That is the\nstandard defense.", "originalText": "Fix: resolve → normalize (removes ..) →\ncheck startsWith(destination). That is the\nstandard defense.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "cy4v8urid3u94sgfdk0q", "type": "rectangle", "x": 965.0, "y": 7969.0, "width": 432.5, "height": 266.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["jgeqe5158oqesux9l0ij"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1578003207, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 753296550, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kcu5x0hc8cah3gdhvs41", "type": "text", "x": 981.0, "y": 7985.0, "width": 132.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["jgeqe5158oqesux9l0ij"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 669640005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1521518716, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3. Zip bomb", "originalText": "3. Zip bomb", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "qfs6hn95s2gkfl5xf50i", "type": "text", "x": 981.0, "y": 8020.0, "width": 385.28000000000003, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["jgeqe5158oqesux9l0ij"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1920060945, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 989661024, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A tiny zip can decompress to gigabytes\n(42.zip is 42 KB compressed and 4.5 PB\nunpacked). Limits applied while extracting:", "originalText": "A tiny zip can decompress to gigabytes\n(42.zip is 42 KB compressed and 4.5 PB\nunpacked). Limits applied while extracting:", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "gbxqj7dpfssbjdx0pkov", "type": "rectangle", "x": 981.0, "y": 8090.0, "width": 400.5, "height": 59.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["jgeqe5158oqesux9l0ij"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1137227360, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1304484941, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "rpyx8hbbjcdiwzod05jh", "type": "text", "x": 993.0, "y": 8102.0, "width": 308.7, "height": 35.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["jgeqe5158oqesux9l0ij"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1687337283, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 437175015, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "if (++fileCount > 10_000) throw ...\nif (totalBytes > 100 MB) throw ...", "originalText": "if (++fileCount > 10_000) throw ...\nif (totalBytes > 100 MB) throw ...", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "mkv0dszrk6ilcg6farmg", "type": "text", "x": 981.0, "y": 8159.0, "width": 376.32000000000005, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["jgeqe5158oqesux9l0ij"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 566575312, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1892486140, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The bytes are counted as they are actually\ndecompressed. The size in the zip header\ncould be a lie.", "originalText": "The bytes are counted as they are actually\ndecompressed. The size in the zip header\ncould be a lie.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "kduwtn5pepl7zqppoau8", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1427.5, "y": 7969.0, "width": 432.5, "height": 273.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["9jrnamz6146vey0a94xf"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 903915863, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 189899802, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ri09m0g8w85y6q8sjy5o", "type": "text", "x": 1443.5, "y": 7985.0, "width": 300.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["9jrnamz6146vey0a94xf"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 896132641, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2029944348, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4. Symlinks & wrong files\n   (JavaCodeChunker)", "originalText": "4. Symlinks & wrong files\n   (JavaCodeChunker)", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "9lbsmwpq82k8ryqf8wxk", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1443.5, "y": 8045.0, "width": 400.5, "height": 111.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["9jrnamz6146vey0a94xf"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 619033545, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 138762864, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "2abkvblpxajmk4x1fdj9", "type": "text", "x": 1455.5, "y": 8057.0, "width": 379.26, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#212529", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["9jrnamz6146vey0a94xf"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 422468904, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 927821996, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Path safeRoot = root.toRealPath();\nPath safeFile = file.toRealPath();\nif (!safeFile.startsWith(safeRoot)\n || !safeFile.toString().endsWith(\".java\"))\n   throw new IllegalArgumentException(...)", "originalText": "Path safeRoot = root.toRealPath();\nPath safeFile = file.toRealPath();\nif (!safeFile.startsWith(safeRoot)\n || !safeFile.toString().endsWith(\".java\"))\n   throw new IllegalArgumentException(...)", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "vchrm3wp8djkluyluyhe", "type": "text", "x": 1443.5, "y": 8166.5, "width": 385.28000000000003, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["9jrnamz6146vey0a94xf"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1190315333, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 428472759, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "toRealPath() follows symlinks. A 'Foo.java'\nthat is really a link to /etc/passwd would\nresolve outside the root and get rejected.", "originalText": "toRealPath() follows symlinks. A 'Foo.java'\nthat is really a link to /etc/passwd would\nresolve outside the root and get rejected.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "6scivuqt2lwhedhthruu", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 8482.5, "width": 1900, "height": 1047.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1849282143, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1943448750, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "dkrlc0y0bhf0riy4kl9a", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 8512.5, "width": 1224.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1041433233, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1339308065, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "6. Chunking: how a file is split  (JavaCodeChunker)", "originalText": "6. Chunking: how a file is split  (JavaCodeChunker)", "fontSize": 40, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "yeavedhr3pceo934t3y4", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 8570.5, "width": 1612.8000000000002, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1325337834, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 264562530, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A sliding window of CHUNK_SIZE = 100 lines that moves forward step = CHUNK_SIZE − OVERLAP = 100 − 20 = 80 lines at a time. Example: a 250-line file (the same as\nJavaCodeChunkerTest).", "originalText": "A sliding window of CHUNK_SIZE = 100 lines that moves forward step = CHUNK_SIZE − OVERLAP = 100 − 20 = 80 lines at a time. Example: a 250-line file (the same as\nJavaCodeChunkerTest).", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "pwg3xg0trky8ryozdppb", "type": "text", "x": 150, "y": 8635.5, "width": 115.19999999999999, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor