ne i\" and checks there\nare 3 chunks, their exact line ranges, the relative path, and\nthat the last line is included.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "g9l9q3cybyc4i6h1m3jl", "type": "rectangle", "x": 656.6666666666666, "y": 12190.0, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 167.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["r7sn1tcjfczwkguy0ofi"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1522304037, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 262380457, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "pzn0thl2c53k9om115bo", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 12206.0, "width": 276.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["r7sn1tcjfczwkguy0ofi"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 491943532, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1548602258, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GithubArchiveClientTest", "originalText": "GithubArchiveClientTest", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "ymyk86adnokku3s710nu", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 12241.0, "width": 537.6, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["r7sn1tcjfczwkguy0ofi"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1075824513, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1114000502, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Starts a REAL tiny HTTP server (com.sun.net.httpserver) on a\nrandom port: /zipball answers 302 → /archive.zip answers 200\nwith a zip built in memory (ZipOutputStream). This proves\nredirects are followed and the bytes arrive intact. No\ninternet needed.", "originalText": "Starts a REAL tiny HTTP server (com.sun.net.httpserver) on a\nrandom port: /zipball answers 302 → /archive.zip answers 200\nwith a zip built in memory (ZipOutputStream). This proves\nredirects are followed and the bytes arrive intact. No\ninternet needed.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "clces1ktior4v1og07vs", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1273.3333333333333, "y": 12190.0, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 187.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ohfddvsz2tvhvwhholi5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 157843391, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 515701852, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "4087ws1loqsot56ag39b", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 12206.0, "width": 192.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ohfddvsz2tvhvwhholi5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 229234835, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 718523289, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GithubChunksTest", "originalText": "GithubChunksTest", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "2eev7inrzjk9e0oawhn2", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 12241.0, "width": 546.5600000000001, "height": 120.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ohfddvsz2tvhvwhholi5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 287604539, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1902421283, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Builds a zip on disk and fakes the GitHub clients with\nanonymous subclasses that override fetchRepo/download (a test\ndouble without Mockito). Checks that folders stay folders,\nthe chunk counts, that temp files are deleted, and that an\nextraction error is rethrown unchanged while the zip still\ngets deleted.", "originalText": "Builds a zip on disk and fakes the GitHub clients with\nanonymous subclasses that override fetchRepo/download (a test\ndouble without Mockito). Checks that folders stay folders,\nthe chunk counts, that temp files are deleted, and that an\nextraction error is rethrown unchanged while the zip still\ngets deleted.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "92mi560tohxwednya3s9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 12407.0, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 107.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["qmpd7z4kso03w2mrop2b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1247352185, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1519446091, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "yee2abg9sho5d5afql0d", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 12423.0, "width": 228.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["qmpd7z4kso03w2mrop2b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 376900894, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1648396939, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GithubValidatorTest", "originalText": "GithubValidatorTest", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "h6m3sgur4pu6w93k8ekt", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 12458.0, "width": 537.6, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["qmpd7z4kso03w2mrop2b"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1704696930, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1133463084, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Accepts https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-petclinic.\nRejects gitlab.com, plain http, and sub-pages like /issues.", "originalText": "Accepts https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-petclinic.\nRejects gitlab.com, plain http, and sub-pages like /issues.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "u9ivlx6x6sxua3kamox9", "type": "rectangle", "x": 656.6666666666666, "y": 12407.0, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 147.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cku7zqj3ovu7pw35x3x1"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1937563905, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1492808329, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "0y14dsf2uwufuk15u248", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 12423.0, "width": 336.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cku7zqj3ovu7pw35x3x1"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1912419402, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 408828771, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GoogleGenAiConfigurationTest", "originalText": "GoogleGenAiConfigurationTest", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "d43i21pu8bwaufxqp6xg", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 12458.0, "width": 519.6800000000001, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["cku7zqj3ovu7pw35x3x1"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 463656435, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 664649964, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ApplicationContextRunner starts ONLY the Gemini\nauto-configurations with a fake key and checks that the\nChatModel and EmbeddingModel beans exist. Tests the wiring\nwithout calling Google.", "originalText": "ApplicationContextRunner starts ONLY the Gemini\nauto-configurations with a fake key and checks that the\nChatModel and EmbeddingModel beans exist. Tests the wiring\nwithout calling Google.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "cwc0bogwhupof0hkarpk", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1273.3333333333333, "y": 12407.0, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["upb22o1tfxdtumw7hu3d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 348562979, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 124944882, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "3513lm7e41ofv14j643f", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 12423.0, "width": 96.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["upb22o1tfxdtumw7hu3d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1615622491, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 480466578, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "api.http", "originalText": "api.http", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "aysv6o9e9nhcgw33a8nc", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 12458.0, "width": 528.6400000000001, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["upb22o1tfxdtumw7hu3d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1392181868, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 599678535, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The IntelliJ HTTP client file: one request per endpoint, in\npipeline order (seed → search → info → download → chunks →\nindex). Run them top to bottom to see each stage.", "originalText": "The IntelliJ HTTP client file: one request per endpoint, in\npipeline order (seed → search → info → download → chunks →\nindex). Run them top to bottom to see each stage.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "q34pggcbi6qsrer6luu6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 12734.0, "width": 1900, "height": 584.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c2255c", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 4, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 521896943, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 280608103, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "7yj8hqde7m7h6oq7qh96", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 12764.0, "width": 960.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c2255c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1456064142, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 218305800, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "10. Things I noticed in the current code", "originalText": "10. Things I noticed in the current code", "fontSize": 40, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "cfnhp39lqt9ngq6tlv0g", "type": "text", "x": 40, "y": 12822.0, "width": 725.7600000000001, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1242977543, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 693685889, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Not bugs in your understanding: real gaps in the code worth fixing next.", "originalText": "Not bugs in your understanding: real gaps in the code worth fixing next.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "o2f2natd4gwlf9yxam97", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 12874.5, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 187.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b5kb3pkbqy3ot760rs6c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1474779022, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 568886906, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "4x56v3dgs9gt0r0vip35", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 12890.5, "width": 408.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b5kb3pkbqy3ot760rs6c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1158266567, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 521901639, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "✗ GithubChunksTest doesn't compile", "originalText": "✗ GithubChunksTest doesn't compile", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "54gylbi18a2vzpy9qzo7", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 12925.5, "width": 519.6800000000001, "height": 120.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b5kb3pkbqy3ot760rs6c"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 506698585, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1933406414, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GithubTestController now takes 6 constructor arguments\n(RepositoryIndexingService was added), but the test's\ncontroller(...) helper still passes 5. `mvn test-compile`\nfails, and that stops EVERY test from running. Fix: pass a\nfake RepositoryIndexingService (or null, since /chunks\ndoesn't use it).", "originalText": "GithubTestController now takes 6 constructor arguments\n(RepositoryIndexingService was added), but the test's\ncontroller(...) helper still passes 5. `mvn test-compile`\nfails, and that stops EVERY test from running. Fix: pass a\nfake RepositoryIndexingService (or null, since /chunks\ndoesn't use it).", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "cw9rtnfw6szf4lur02ty", "type": "rectangle", "x": 656.6666666666666, "y": 12874.5, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ofcx7culoqvbv1jpvkta"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1405796, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 855973358, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "f6blbv0xt9vyske5m0sw", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 12890.5, "width": 348.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ofcx7culoqvbv1jpvkta"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1390003373, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 180418976, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "⚠ Search can't see real repos", "originalText": "⚠ Search can't see real repos", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "kqtq36zpmg6ooh1xawj2", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 12925.5, "width": 519.6800000000001, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["ofcx7culoqvbv1jpvkta"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2069151261, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1318606972, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CodeSearchService filters on repositoryId == 'demo-repo'.\nMake repositoryId a parameter of GET /code-search so repos\nindexed via /index can be searched.", "originalText": "CodeSearchService filters on repositoryId == 'demo-repo'.\nMake repositoryId a parameter of GET /code-search so repos\nindexed via /index can be searched.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "47dznaxs88ualry3igwe", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1273.3333333333333, "y": 12874.5, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 167.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xy2nz5x51o0lqbyg6g04"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1450467817, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1919565044, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "jgsqof3wgi8y0423h7t6", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 12890.5, "width": 384.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xy2nz5x51o0lqbyg6g04"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1229637261, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2006901461, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "⚠ Re-indexing creates duplicates", "originalText": "⚠ Re-indexing creates duplicates", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "dojy6g107g8o8g8hzmvy", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 12925.5, "width": 528.6400000000001, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["xy2nz5x51o0lqbyg6g04"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 219517341, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 480077824, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Calling POST /index twice on the same repo inserts every\nchunk again. Before indexing, delete the rows for that\nrepositoryId, or skip when the commitSha is already indexed\n(the empty V2__create_repositories.sql looks like the place\nfor that table).", "originalText": "Calling POST /index twice on the same repo inserts every\nchunk again. Before indexing, delete the rows for that\nrepositoryId, or skip when the commitSha is already indexed\n(the empty V2__create_repositories.sql looks like the place\nfor that table).", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "pcl1s2qpkgrmm0ytmv82", "type": "rectangle", "x": 40.0, "y": 13091.5, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 147.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["su7errbszujb4hllqlld"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 681455143, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1691374840, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "0n53r4sip4b8j4zxd82b", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 13107.5, "width": 444.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["su7errbszujb4hllqlld"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 759907505, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 380802001, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "↻ Pipeline logic sits in a controller", "originalText": "↻ Pipeline logic sits in a controller", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "qw8evrc0erje4s4mfel3", "type": "text", "x": 56.0, "y": 13142.5, "width": 546.5600000000001, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["su7errbszujb4hllqlld"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1738155531, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1666144793, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "/chunks and /index repeat the same download → extract → chunk\n→ cleanup code. Moving it into one IngestionService\n(controller = HTTP only) removes the duplication and makes it\neasy to test.", "originalText": "/chunks and /index repeat the same download → extract → chunk\n→ cleanup code. Moving it into one IngestionService\n(controller = HTTP only) removes the duplication and makes it\neasy to test.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "gt30gchf4akdnadijfzq", "type": "rectangle", "x": 656.6666666666666, "y": 13091.5, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["zwge8683ple45b2nixi8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 52023620, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1143563208, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e55325cambhwtgdk4snv", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 13107.5, "width": 252.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["zwge8683ple45b2nixi8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2136961876, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1539182068, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "↻ Whole zip in memory", "originalText": "↻ Whole zip in memory", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "rr49hqwp8xfans0gnh8s", "type": "text", "x": 672.6666666666666, "y": 13142.5, "width": 528.6400000000001, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["zwge8683ple45b2nixi8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1729550603, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1747122368, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "body(byte[].class) loads the entire archive into RAM, while\nextraction has a 100 MB limit. Streaming the download to\ndisk, with a size limit, would make the two consistent.", "originalText": "body(byte[].class) loads the entire archive into RAM, while\nextraction has a 100 MB limit. Streaming the download to\ndisk, with a size limit, would make the two consistent.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "6hulprx05h3k7ujj31w0", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1273.3333333333333, "y": 13091.5, "width": 586.6666666666666, "height": 187.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["fqsdq26rl0nwrn57lws1"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 387535898, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1918286809, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "yq6t0otgpeqcyh207x88", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 13107.5, "width": 168.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["fqsdq26rl0nwrn57lws1"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1988756990, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 62849465, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "✎ Small things", "originalText": "✎ Small things", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "lguuw05802xvxitifxzi", "type": "text", "x": 1289.3333333333333, "y": 13142.5, "width": 528.6400000000001, "height": 120.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["fqsdq26rl0nwrn57lws1"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1240397619, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1837599555, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795031332816, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "• Typo: \"Unsave Zip entry\" → \"Unsafe\"\n• /download leaves its zip in /tmp\n• Errors surface as 500s; a @RestControllerAdvice could map\n  IllegalArgumentException → 400\n• No GitHub token, so the 60 requests/hour limit is easy to\n  hit", "originalText": "• Typo: \"Unsave Zip entry\" → \"Unsafe\"\n• /download leaves its zip in /tmp\n• Errors surface as 500s; a @RestControllerAdvice could map\n  IllegalArgumentException → 400\n• No GitHub token, so the 60 requests/hour limit is easy to\n  hit", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}